    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `oauth_callback.py` file, I need to include the necessary code to handle the OAuth callback and exchange an authorization code for tokens using a concrete external provider. I will use Google's OAuth 2.0 service as the external provider, which is identifiable by the `google-auth` library and the specific URLs used for the OAuth flow. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789863081101,
          "start": 1789863077308
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc2725bc0011Wr8quDW8OEwze",
