      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To start an OAuth or OIDC authorization-code login, I need to use a concrete external provider. Google is a widely used provider for OAuth. I will use the Google OAuth2 API to create the script. The script will import the necessary Google-specific libraries and use Google's OAuth2 endpoints to initiate the login process. </thinking>\n",
